### ========================================
### 2. Get History
### ========================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vton/history?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 3. Get Session Detail
### ========================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vton/session/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 4. Delete Session
### ========================================

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/vton/session/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### HELPER: Get JWT Token (Login first)
### ========================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "khang393324@gmail.com",
  "password": "Khang@0937393324"
